 data-track-index="4" style="z-index:51;left:465px;top:1214px;width:150px;height:150px"><img src="assets/icons/png/happy.png" alt=""></div><div id="cap35" class="clip cap" data-start="33.467" data-duration="2.020" data-track-index="3" style="z-index:50;top:1060px"><div class="ln" id="cap35-0" style="font-size:83.5px">In between,</div><div class="ln it" id="cap35-1" style="font-size:81px">everybody just hangs out.</div></div><div id="cap36" class="clip cap" data-start="35.507" data-duration="1.740" data-track-index="3" style="z-index:50;top:1060px"><div class="ln" id="cap36-0" style="font-size:83.5px">New families</div><div class="ln it" id="cap36-1" style="font-size:83.5px">meet the coaches,</div></div><div id="cap37" class="clip cap" data-start="37.267" data-duration="1.705" data-track-index="3" style="z-index:50;top:1060px"><div class="ln" id="cap37-0" style="font-size:83.5px">kids meet players</div><div class="ln it" id="cap37-1" style="font-size:83.5px">from other teams,</div></div><div id="cap38" class="clip cap" data-start="38.992" data-duration="1.660" data-track-index="3" style="z-index:50;top:1000px"><div class="ln" id="cap38-0" style="font-size:83.5px">and then at the very end</div><div class="ln it" id="cap38-1" style="font-size:83.5px">of the night,</div></div><div id="ic39" class="clip icon" data-start="38.992" data-duration="1.660" data-track-index="4" style="z-index:51;left:465px;top:1214px;width:150px;height:150px"><img src="assets/icons/png/clock.png" alt=""></div><div id="cap40" class="clip cap" data-start="40.672" data-duration="0.898" data-track-index="3" style="z-index:50;top:1060px"><div class="ln capw" id="cap40-0"><div class="bwin" style="font-size:92px" data-layout-allow-occlusion data-layout-allow-overlap><span class="rgb r" data-layout-allow-occlusion>THE BIG MOMENT,</span><span class="rgb c" data-layout-allow-occlusion>THE BIG MOMENT,</span><span class="gfill">THE BIG MOMENT,</span></div></div></div><div id="cap41" class="clip cap" data-s