ow-occlusion>RAISING MONEY</span><span class="rgb c" data-layout-allow-occlusion>RAISING MONEY</span><span class="gfill">RAISING MONEY</span></div></div><div class="ln it" id="cap45-2" style="font-size:83.5px">while you&#x27;re at it.</div></div><div id="cap46" class="clip cap" data-start="54.147" data-duration="1.062" data-track-index="3" style="z-index:50;top:1000px"><div class="ln" id="cap46-0" style="font-size:83.5px">Planning</div><div class="ln it" id="cap46-1" style="font-size:83.5px">next season?</div></div><div id="ic47" class="clip icon" data-start="54.147" data-duration="1.062" data-track-index="4" style="z-index:51;left:465px;top:1214px;width:150px;height:150px"><img src="assets/icons/png/calendar.png" alt=""></div><div id="cap48" class="clip cap" data-start="55.229" data-duration="1.720" data-track-index="3" style="z-index:50;top:1060px"><div class="ln capw" id="cap48-0"><div class="bwin" style="font-size:92px" data-layout-allow-occlusion data-layout-allow-overlap><span class="rgb r" data-layout-allow-occlusion>SAVE THIS</span><span class="rgb c" data-layout-allow-occlusion>SAVE THIS</span><span class="gfill">SAVE THIS</span></div></div><div class="ln it" id="cap48-1" style="font-size:83.5px">for your kickoff night</div></div><div id="cta" class="clip cap" data-start="56.959" data-duration="1.933" data-track-index="3" style="z-index:50;top:1060px"><div class="ln" id="cta0">and share it</div><div class="ln it" id="cta1"><span class="cream">with your <span class="grn">club board.</span></span></div></div><div id="broll1w" class="brw" style="z-index:20"><video id="broll1" class="clip" data-start="13.595" data-duration="2.920" data-track-index="5" src="assets/broll/b1.mp4" muted playsinline></video></div><div class="burnw" style="z-index:80" data-layout-allow-occlusion><video id="broll1fb0" data-layout-allow-occlusion class="clip" data-start="13.165" data-duration="0.750" data-track-index="10" src="assets/broll/fb_v.mp4" muted playsinline></video></div><div